      "animal_absorbs_light_slowly_releases_i": "Animal absorbs light + slowly releases it over seconds-to-minutes (glow-in-the-dark toys). Almost no animals do this naturally — it's mostly a synthetic effect.",
      "animal_absorbs_short_wavelength_light_": "Animal absorbs short-wavelength light + re-emits longer-wavelength light. Needs an external light source. Many corals + some fish do this — different from bioluminescence.",
