      "cladistic_logic_says_a_clade_includes_": "Cladistic logic says a clade includes ALL descendants of an ancestor. Birds descended from theropod dinosaurs — and dinosaurs were reptiles — so technically birds belong inside the reptile clade. We split them out for convenience because feathers are so distinctive.",
