      "yes_acquired_traits_are_passed_to_offs": "Yes — acquired traits are passed to offspring",
      "yes_but_only_after_many_generations_of": "Yes — but only after many generations of weightlifting",
      "yes_but_only_if_many_giraffes_need_it_": "Yes — but only if many giraffes need it at once",
      "yes_every_aspect_of_evolution_is_purel": "Yes — every aspect of evolution is purely random",
      "yes_every_species_is_moving_toward_an_": "Yes — every species is moving toward an \"ideal\" form",
      "yes_evolution_covers_everything_from_n": "Yes — evolution covers everything from non-life to humans",
      "yes_evolution_proved_life_came_from_no": "Yes — evolution proved life came from non-life",
      "yes_life_is_constantly_improving_towar": "Yes — life is constantly improving toward greater complexity",
