      "wildfire_carbon_ledger": "Wildfire carbon ledger",
      "wildfire_is_carbon_neutral_over_decade": "Wildfire is carbon-neutral over decades — trees regrow, sequester. But MEGAFIRES release decades of stored carbon in days, and warmer climate slows regrowth. Net-positive emitter.",
