      "kin_boltz": "Share of collisions with enough energy",
      "kin_bust": "Drag the catalyst slider as far as it goes. The hill collapses, the rate jumps by orders of magnitude, and the two ends of the curve do not budge. A catalyst changes how fast you get there, never where you end up, and never the equilibrium position.",
