      "wwi_posters": "WWI posters",
      "wwi_posters_nazi_propaganda_soviet_pos": "WWI posters, Nazi propaganda, Soviet posters, civil rights pamphlets, modern political ads. Print as instrument of persuasion + manipulation.",
