      "just_one_mile_pressure": "\"Just one mile\" pressure",
      "k_turn_practice_2d_top_down_with_step_": "K-turn practice (2D top-down with step guidance).",
      "keep_your_commitment_read_it_again_any": "Keep your commitment. Read it again any time — revisit before a long drive, or after a close call.",
